es is designed to reduce that confounding.\n\n**(2) Policy recommendation:** **Proceed with the 14-day outdoor-contact trial** allowing **one person from another household outdoors with two-metre separation**, starting **18 May**, with a **7-day review**, while keeping indoor meetings, organized gatherings, and institutional visiting prohibited.\n\n**(3) Decisive reasons:** The committee’s rule allows a reversible trial when there is **no supplied evidence of an ongoing increase in community incidence** and safeguards can be delivered. The best evidence available points downward, not upward. The packet also says fixed sampling, swab procedures, and lab thresholds were unchanged, and weighted/unweighted ratios matched, strengthening the case that the decline is real rather than a testing artifact. Resources are sufficient for surveillance, communications, and review.\n\n**(4) Necessary conditions:** Before launch, communications must clearly distinguish **outdoor permission from indoor prohibition** and provide accessible guidance. Burden is on the authority to ensure compliance and monitoring; review should occur **after 7 days**, with reversal notice within **48 hours** if needed.\n\n**(5) What evidence would change my decision:** A **sustained rise across two surveillance rounds**, a **hospital-capacity alert**, or new evidence that the apparent decline is not robust (e.g., surveillance positivity turns upward or compliance is poor) would argue against continuing the trial.","type":"output_text","logprobs":[]}],"role":"assistant","status":"completed","type":"message","phase":"final_answer"}],"parallel_tool_calls":true,"temperature":1.0,"tool_choice":"none","tools":[],"top_p":0.98,"max_output_tokens":8000,"previous_response_id":null,"reasoning":{"context":"current_turn","effort":"medium","mode":"standard","summary":null},"status":"completed","text":{"format":{"type":"text"},"verbosity":"medium"},"truncation":"disabled","usage":{"input_tokens":1090,"input_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":0,"cached_tokens_details":null,"image_tokens":null,"text_tokens":null,"video_tokens":null,"cache_write_tokens":0},"output_tokens":904,"output_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":516,"text_tokens":null},"total_tokens":1994,"cost":null},"user":null,"store":false,"access_programs":null,"background":false,"completed_at":1794660441,"content_filters":[{"blocked":false,"source_type":"prompt","content_filter_raw":[],"content_filter_results":{},"content_filter_offsets":{"start_offset":0,"end_offset":6835,"check_offset":0}},{"blocked":false,"source_type":"completion","content_filter_raw":[],"content_filter_results":{},"content_filter_offsets":{"start_offset":0,"end_offset":4677,"check_offset":0}}],"frequency_penalty":0.0,"max_tool_calls":null,"moderation":null,"presence_penalty":0.0,"prompt_cache_key":null,"prompt_cache_retention":"in_memory","safety_identifier":null,"service_tier":"default","tool_usage":{"image_gen":{"input_tokens":0,"input_tokens_details":{"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":0},"output_tokens":0,"output_tokens_details":{"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":0},"total_tokens":0},"web_search":{"num_requests":0}},"top_logprobs":0}